theme_override_styles/normal = SubResource("StyleBoxEmpty_6ogxm")
text = "Day 1

I don't remember much about the crash.

One moment everything was fine. The next, alarms were screaming and the entire ship was shaking.

When I woke up, the emergency lights were on. Most of the systems were offline.

There's a forest outside the windows. I have no idea where we landed.

First priority: restore power.

Second priority: figure out where the hell we are."
wrap_mode = 1

