placeholder_text = "Day 2

The communications room is locked.

I found several strange symbols scattered around the ship. Some of them look familiar, but I can't remember why.

The electrical wiring is damaged. I might be able to reconnect it if I find the right tools.

Things to investigate:

- The locked communications room
- The damaged wiring
- The strange symbols
- The emergency power system

I also keep hearing something outside.

Probably just the wind."
wrap_mode = 1
scroll_smooth = true
minimap_draw = true

